<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Bass raised at Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bass raised at Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in brewing to leisure group Bass Plc opened steadily on Friday after analysts at Lehman Brothers upgraded the stock to &quot;outperform&quot; from &quot;neutral&quot;.</p>
<p>Dealers said analysts at Lehman Brothers gave the shares a target price of 860p. The shares were quoted at 782p shortly after the market opened.</p>
<p>Lehman analysts declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- Elaine Hardcastle, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
